giac for Debian
---------------

GIAC is a Computer Algebra System library. This package provides:
- libgiac: core CAS shared library
- icas: interactive command-line CAS shell
- aide: help tool
- hevea2mml: LaTeX to MathML converter

The Xcas graphical frontend is available as a separate package
(see https://github.com/s-celles/xcas).

Building uses the Meson build system. See BUILDING.md for details.
